          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Method: On-site interviews with stakeholders, transcription and pseudonymisation interview data.\n<br>\nUniverse: A total of 120 individuals from 110 different organizations across the seven regions were interviewed. The share of female participants in the interviews was 52%. Share of each group was as following: 24% regional governments, 20% local governments, 9% other governments, 22% civil society, 11% Private sector; 14% research and education."
